MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_001: Heh! Right on target. That felt good.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_002: Heyyy, Inyoniii! Just swinging by to see how\nyou are.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_003: Oh, hello, Dadao.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_004: You train a lot, don't ya? Seems like you've been\nworking at it all day.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_005: If you push yourself too hard, you might keel over.\nWhy don't you have some of my food and water?
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_006: I prepared my own provisions. I don't need yours.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_007: Gotcha. It's good to be prepared. Welp, I'll go ahead\nand eat it myself, then.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_008: Here? This isn't a good place to eat.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_009: What's that? Oh, nah, it's fine. I'll eat anywhere.\nDon't mind me.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_010: {SetColor=Gray}It's hard not to... *sigh*{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_011: Aha! I knew it.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_012: Hm? Knew what?
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_013: Inyoni, you like me, don't you!
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_014: I'm sorry?
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_015: You can barely make eye contact, and you keep\nrunning away. You don't need to be shy!
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_016: At first, I thought you hated me, but unlike other\ngirls, you never turn me down.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_017: Clearly you've got a big, fat crush on me! That's the\nonly explanation.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_018: {SetColor=Gray}I kept my distance because he annoys me. And\nnow this?{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_019: Listen to me, Dadao.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_020: I am all ears! I'm here to listen and support your\nfeelings. Go on—I'm ready!
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_021: Let me be very clear. I despise you.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_022: Well, of course! I'm a total catch! I— Wait... Huh?
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_023: You're fundamentally clownish and incredibly noisy.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_024: And you repeatedly interfere with my training. \nSo that's why I dislike you. Goodbye now.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_025: Wuh? What'd I do? Did I lose consciousness for a\nsecond there...
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_C_026: Wait, she's gone? Why'd she leave?!
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_001: Hyeh... Heh... Hyah!
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_002: Training without disruption is blissful. Except for\nthis arm that keeps acting up.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_003: I can't damage it again. I guess that's enough\nfor today.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_004: Oh! A giant rukh bird! I could take it down in one\nshot. Just aim for the head...
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_005: Missed! A-again?! Damn! My arm... I can't...
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_006: Is this where I meet my end?
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_007: End shmend! Rrraaah!
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_008: Dadao?!
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_009: You're safe now. Looks like the club made its mark.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_010: It's not safe to be in these mountains alone. I was\nworried about you, so I followed you.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_011: I appreciate the help. But why go to such trouble\nfor me?
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_012: I told you I hated you.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_013: Yeah, so? Tons of people hate me.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_014: It doesn't really matter. Especially since I like you\nso much.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_015: You're alone a lot, aren't you? Me too. So it bothered\nme seeing you wandering off on your own.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_016: Hm. Maybe I misjudged you. I... I no longer\ndespise you.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_017: That's right! You recognize just how great I am now!\nSo you got a crush on me yet?
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_018: Not at all. I'm grateful for the help, but I still find\nyou exasperating.
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_019: Aw, come on! Even though I'm a fantastic guy?
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_020: Shoot. Well, I'll just have to hang around until you\nsee how great I am!
MID_SE_Dai_Ini_B_021: If you insist.